- The Chinese name of this weapon shares exactly the same naming pattern as the three weapons in the Millennial Movement Series of Mondstadt: Each name has an overall structure of (2-character word)-(2-character word)-之-(1-character noun) ; The last characters in the four weapon's names are nouns that all match in pronunciation (homophones, except in tone): 史 shǐ ("history"), for The Daybreak Chronicles; 诗 shī ("poem"), for Elegy for the End ; 时 shí ("time"), for Song of Broken Pines ; 誓 shì ("oath"), for Freedom-Sworn .
